cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "df-augment"
abstract: >
  A standalone Python package that turns one parquet dataset into a
  larger, augmented parquet dataset. Every synthetic row records which
  original sample(s) it came from via the aug_source_group column,
  preventing augmented data from leaking into test sets when used with
  df-analyze or DeepTune.
authors:
